[{"answer":"Hi, can I help you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/1.mp3"},{"answer":"I was told to come here, because I'd like to talk to someone about taking a management course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Right. I'm one of the tutors, so I should be able to help you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/4.mp3"},{"answer":"My name's Brian Ardley.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/5.mp3"},{"answer":"I've decided to enroll on a part time management course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/6.mp3"},{"answer":"A friend of mine took one last year, and recommended it to me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Is there anything I should do before the course, like reading or anything?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/9.mp3"},{"answer":"We prefer to integrate reading with the course,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/10.mp3"},{"answer":"so we don't give out a reading list in advance.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/11.mp3"},{"answer":"But we like people to write a case study, describing an organisation they know.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/12.mp3"},{"answer":"I've already done that, as my friends told me you wanted one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/13.mp3"},{"answer":"But would it be possible to sit in on a teaching session, to see what it's like?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/14.mp3"},{"answer":"I haven't been a student for quite a while.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Just let me know which date, and I'll arrange it with the tutor.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, could I ask you about the college facilities, please?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Anything in particular?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, the course is one day a week, all day, isn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/20.mp3"},{"answer":"So presumably it's possible to buy food?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, the refectory's open all day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Does it cater for special diets? I have some food allergies.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Provided you warn the refectory in advance, it won't be a problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/25.mp3"},{"answer":"What about facilities for young children?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/26.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd like to bring my daughter here while I'm studying.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/27.mp3"},{"answer":"How old is she?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Three.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Then she's eligible to join the nursery,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/30.mp3"},{"answer":"which is supervised by a qualified Nursery Nurse.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/31.mp3"},{"answer":"The waiting list for a place is quite long though, so you ought to apply now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/33.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't know if our careers advice service would be of any interest to you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it might help me decide how to develop my career after the course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/35.mp3"},{"answer":"The centre has a lot of reference materials, and staff qualified to give guidance on a one-to-one basis.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/36.mp3"},{"answer":"I noticed a fitness centre next to the college.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Is that for students?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/38.mp3"},{"answer":"It's open to everyone, but students pay an annual fee that's much less than the general public pay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/39.mp3"},{"answer":"And presumably the college library stocks newspapers and journals, as well as books?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, and there's also an audio-visual room, for viewing and listening to videos, cassettes, and so on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Is there also access to computers?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, your tutor will need to arrange with the technical support team for you to get a password,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/43.mp3"},{"answer":"so ask him or her about it when you start the course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/45.mp3"},{"answer":"By the way, do you know about our Business Centre?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/46.mp3"},{"answer":"No, What's that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/47.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a training resource - a collection of materials for people to study on their own, or use in their own organisations.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/48.mp3"},{"answer":"You mean books and videos?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, and manuals for self-study.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Plus a lot of computer-based materials, so people can work through them at their own speed,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/51.mp3"},{"answer":"and repeat anything they aren't sure about.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/52.mp3"},{"answer":"And you can hire laptops to use in your own home or workplace","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/53.mp3"},{"answer":"as well as printers that you can take away.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Does it have anything that I could use to improve my study skills?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/55.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't have much idea about report writing,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/56.mp3"},{"answer":"and I'm sure I'll need it on the course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yes, there's plenty of useful material. Just ask one of the staff.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Does the centre cover all the main areas of business?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, topics like finance, and of course marketing - that's a popular one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Local managers seem to queue up to borrow the videos!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/61.mp3"},{"answer":"So it isn't just for students, then?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/62.mp3"},{"answer":"No, it's for members only, but anyone can join.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/63.mp3"},{"answer":"How much does it cost?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/64.mp3"},{"answer":"£100 a year for a company,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/65.mp3"},{"answer":"and £50 for an individual, with no discount for students, I'm afraid.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/66.mp3"},{"answer":"That's very helpful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I think that's all.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/68.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd better go home and fill in the enrollment form.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks for all your help.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/70.mp3"},{"answer":"You're welcome.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Goodbye.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Goodbye.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-1-part-3-2023-08-01-17-20-30/73.mp3"}]
